From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Frida Hou <Frida-a@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:44:03 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] [QW38] flashinfer: no host seq_lens read for non-causal
 trtllm-api decode-only (draft) batches

On SM120 the DFlash2 drafter uses XQA decode with eager metadata rebuild;
build() called seq_lens.cpu() because all_uses_trtllm requires causal,
syncing the host with the target forward every step (1.7-2.2 ms/step host
gap on RTX PRO 6000 (SM120)). The XQA path reads seq_lens on the GPU only, so the host copy
was unused. Kernels and inputs unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 vllm/v1/attention/backends/flashinfer.py | 14 +++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/vllm/v1/attention/backends/flashinfer.py b/vllm/v1/attention/backends/flashinfer.py
index f70a8f398..cbed475a5 100755
--- a/vllm/v1/attention/backends/flashinfer.py
+++ b/vllm/v1/attention/backends/flashinfer.py
@@ -1831,7 +1831,19 @@ class FlashInferMetadataBuilder(AttentionMetadataBuilder[FlashInferMetadata]):
         # When all attention (both prefill and decode) uses TRTLLM,
         # seq_lens_cpu is not needed since TRTLLM paths use GPU tensors
         # (block_tables, seq_lens) directly.
-        needs_seq_lens_cpu = self.use_dcp or not all_uses_trtllm
+        # A non-causal (draft) batch routed entirely to XQA/trtllm-gen decode
+        # also reads seq_lens and block tables on the GPU only. Reading
+        # seq_lens on the host here would sync with the in-flight target
+        # forward every draft step (QW38 host gap on SM120).
+        noncausal_trtllm_decode_only = (
+            not causal
+            and num_prefills == 0
+            and num_decodes > 0
+            and decode_with_flashinfer_trtllm_api
+        )
+        needs_seq_lens_cpu = self.use_dcp or not (
+            all_uses_trtllm or noncausal_trtllm_decode_only
+        )
         if needs_seq_lens_cpu:
             if (
                 self._num_speculative_tokens == 0
